---
import BlockLayout from '../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import { MONEY, NOTE_DESIGNS, NORDIC_STUDIES, CAMPAIGN_POSTERS } from '../lib/nouns-money';
import '../styles/nouns-money.css';
import HUNDRED from '../data/nouns-money-hundred.json';
const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'CreativeWork', name: 'Nouns Money — collectible art',
  url: MONEY.canonical, description: MONEY.disclosure, datePublished: MONEY.publishedAt,
  creator: {'@type': 'Person', name: 'Mike Hoydich'}, author: {'@type': 'Organization', name: 'Codex'},
  isAccessibleForFree: true, genre: 'Independent collectible art concept',
};
---
<BlockLayout title="Nouns Money · collect a little, pass a story" description="Collect Nouns Money: one hundred distinct CC0 Nouns in a new art catalog, fourteen 2027 studies, print proofs and a proposed community collectible. Collectible art, never cash." image="/images/og/nouns-money.png" themeColor="#f6edcd" immersive hideAds showNetworkStrip={false} jsonLd={jsonLd} alternates={[{type:'application/json', href:'/nouns-money.json', title:'Nouns Money · machine edition'}]}>
  <main class="nm" id="main-content" data-nouns-money>
    <div id="top"></div>
    <div class="nm-top"><a href="/">POINTCAST ↗</a><span>CH.ESC · ART IN CIRCULATION</span><a href="/nouns-money.json">MACHINE EDITION</a></div>
    <header class="nm-hero">
      <div class="nm-hero-copy">
        <p class="nm-kicker">COLLECTIBLE ART CONCEPT · NORDIC SERIES / 2027</p>
        <h1>Nouns<br/><em>Money.</em></h1>
        <p class="nm-motto">Collect a little.<br/>Pass a story.</p>
        <p class="nm-dek">One hundred different Nouns. A collecting room for art, future adventures and the people who make them happen.</p>
        <nav aria-label="Inside Nouns Money"><a class="nm-button" href="#hundred">Let’s collect ↓</a><a href="#nordic-2027">2027 studies ↗</a><a href="#print-proofs">Print proofs ↓</a><a href="#journeys">Follow a serial ↗</a><a href="/nouns-money/editions/">50 new editions ↗</a><a href="/nouns-money/community/">City atlas ↗</a><a href="/nouns-money/marketplace/">Local resources ↗</a></nav>
        <p class="nm-disclosure">Collectible paper art, never cash. Independent concept. No banking, deposits, cash redemption or financial offer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="nm-hero-art" aria-label="A stack of Nouns Money collectible designs">
        <span class="nm-roundel">100<br/>NOUNS<br/><i>one new series</i></span>
        <img class="nm-stack nm-stack-back" src="/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/Nouns-Money-2027-Noun-099-NM27-000100.webp" width="1500" height="750" alt="Nordic 2027 collectible design using actual Noun #99"/>
        <img class="nm-stack nm-stack-mid" src="/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/Nouns-Money-2027-Noun-042-NM27-000043.webp" width="1500" height="750" alt="Nordic 2027 collectible design using actual Noun #42"/>
        <img class="nm-stack nm-stack-front" src="/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/Nouns-Money-2027-Noun-000-NM27-000001.webp" width="1500" height="750" alt="Nordic 2027 collectible design using actual Noun #0" fetchpriority="high"/>
        <p class="nm-hero-caption">LET’S COLLECT NOUNS MONEY.<br/>THE GOOD PART IS WHAT HAPPENS NEXT.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="nm-ribbon"><span>ACTUAL NOUNS · CC0 ART</span><span>⌐◨-◨</span><span>COLLECT · ART-TRADE · TELL A STORY</span></div>
    <section class="nm-section nm-intro" aria-labelledby="idea-title">
      <div><p class="nm-kicker">LET’S MAKE A GREAT SET</p><h2 id="idea-title">A favorite.<br/>A few friends.<br/><em>A whole set.</em></h2></div>
      <div><p class="nm-lead">The joy of a trading card. The character of an old concert ticket. Actual Nouns, remade as little paper worlds.</p><p>“Money” is the art idea. These designs are collectibles for voluntary art trades. Their numbers and serials carry no monetary value, redemption promise, NFT rights or ownership claim.</p><div class="nm-status"><strong>Here today</strong><p>A hundred distinct Nouns, original-art downloads, fourteen visual studies, print-proof PDFs and a browser-local saved set for the original ten designs.</p><strong>Up ahead</strong><p>A physical print edition, hosted art table, moderated serial stories and possible Tezos companions.</p></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="nm-section nm-hundred" id="hundred" aria-labelledby="hundred-title">
      <div class="nm-heading"><div><p class="nm-kicker">NORDIC SERIES / 2027 · ACTUAL NOUNS #0–99</p><h2 id="hundred-title">One hundred notes.<br/><em>One hundred Nouns.</em></h2></div><p>A fresh series with a different authentic Noun in every design. Original pixel art, a quiet currency-inspired layout and the same numeral: one. NM27-000001 through NM27-000100 identify the digital designs; they are not records of issued notes or minted tokens.</p></div>
      <a class="nm-hundred-overview" href="/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/all-100.png"><img src="/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/all-100.webp" width="2200" height="1198" alt="Overview of all one hundred Nordic 2027 Nouns Money art designs, each with a distinct authentic Noun #0–99" loading="lazy"/></a>
      <div class="nm-hundred-downloads">{[0,25,50,75].map(start=><div><h3>Nouns {String(start).padStart(3,'0')}–{String(start+24).padStart(3,'0')}</h3>{HUNDRED.downloads.filter(d=>d.nouns[0]===start).map(d=><a href={d.url} download>{d.format==='PNG'?'25 original PNGs':'25 editable SVGs + bleed'} ↓ <span>{(d.bytes/1e6).toFixed(1)} MB</span></a>)}</div>)}</div>
      <p class="nm-footnote">150 × 75 mm · 1800 × 900 px · RGB. Editable SVG packs include 3 mm paper-background bleed variants at 156 × 81 mm. Confirm output profile, stock and a physical proof with the printer. <a href="/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/provenance.json">Source provenance</a> · <a href="/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/verification.json">100-artwork verification</a>. All files are collectible artwork, never legal tender; no source NFT ownership or Nouns DAO endorsement is implied.</p>
      <details class="nm-hundred-catalog"><summary>Browse the full 100-design art catalog ↗</summary><div class="nm-hundred-grid">{HUNDRED.catalog.map(note=><article><a href={`/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/${note.file}.png`}><img src={`/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/${note.file}.webp`} width="1000" height="500" loading="lazy" alt={`Nouns Money Nordic 2027 design with authentic Noun #${note.nounId}, design serial ${note.serial}`}/></a><p>Noun #{note.nounId} · {note.serial}</p><a href={`/images/nouns-money/nordic-100/${note.file}.svg`} download>Original SVG ↗</a></article>)}</div></details>
      <div class="nm-community"><p class="nm-kicker">FOUNDING COMMUNITY COLLECTIBLE · PROPOSED</p><h3>Art first.<br/>Let’s build the next chapter.</h3><p>A possible Tezos collection for people who want to help shape Nouns Money: art afternoons, future launches and useful community projects. This is a read-only art catalog today.</p><p class="nm-mint-status"><strong>Tezos mint not yet available.</strong> No verified Nouns Money contract, live mint destination or wallet connection is configured.</p><p>Price, supply, edition caps and eligibility are still decisions to make. A free claim with network gas only is one recommendation. Future events and drops are proposed; this artwork guarantees no allocations, airdrops, access, returns, backing or redemption.</p><a href="#build">See the build scope ↗</a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="nm-section nm-collection" id="collection" aria-labelledby="collection-title">
      <div class="nm-heading"><div><p class="nm-kicker">ORIGINAL TEN · COLLECTION 01 / 2026</p><h2 id="collection-title">Which one<br/><em>is yours?</em></h2></div><p>Save favorites from the original ten-design set. This is a personal design list in this browser, not proof of owning a paper note or an NFT. No account needed. <a href="https://nouns.wtf/brand">About the CC0 Nouns art ↗</a></p></div>
      <div class="nm-set-bar"><div><span class="nm-kicker">MY SAVED DESIGNS</span><p data-set-count aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">0 / 10 saved</p></div><div class="nm-set-actions"><button type="button" data-set-export>Export my set ↗</button><a href={MONEY.download} download>Download all ten originals ↓</a></div></div>
      <p class="nm-storage" data-set-storage role="status">Saved on this device only. Clearing browser data removes the saved list; export a copy to keep it.</p>
      <noscript><p class="nm-storage">The gallery and downloads work without JavaScript. Enable JavaScript to save a design set in this browser.</p></noscript>
      <div class="nm-note-grid">{NOTE_DESIGNS.map((note, i)=><article class="nm-note" data-note-card={note.id}>
        <a class="nm-note-art" href={`/images/nouns-money/${note.file}.svg`} aria-label={`Open ${note.name} original SVG`}><img src={`/images/nouns-money/${note.file}.webp`} alt={`${note.name}: Nouns Money collectible art design using actual Nouns ${note.nouns.map(n=>`#${n}`).join(', ')}`} width="1500" height="750" loading="lazy"/></a>
        <div class="nm-note-caption"><div><p class="nm-kicker">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / {note.series}</p><h3>{note.name}</h3><p class="nm-note-nouns">{note.nouns.map(n=>`NOUN #${n}`).join(' · ')} · {note.specimenId}</p></div><button type="button" data-save-design={note.id} aria-pressed="false" aria-label={`Save ${note.name}`}>Save design +</button></div>
        <a class="nm-flat-link" href={`/images/nouns-money/${note.file}.svg`} download>Flat original SVG ↗</a>
      </article>)}</div>
      <p class="nm-footnote"><a href="/images/nouns-money/provenance.json">Read the artwork provenance</a>. Original Noun pixels and colors are preserved in the flat designs. NM-A identifiers label designs; they are not unique issued-note serials. Independent CC0 art use implies neither ownership of the source NFTs nor Nouns DAO endorsement. These are design prototypes; no physical edition has been manufactured or verified.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="nm-section nm-nordic" id="nordic-2027" aria-labelledby="nordic-title">
      <div class="nm-heading"><div><p class="nm-kicker">{NORDIC_STUDIES.length} VISUAL STUDIES · NORDIC / 2027</p><h2 id="nordic-title">Nordic notes.<br/><em>A 2027 daydream.</em></h2></div><p>A Swedish-inspired currency direction: generous numerals, quiet color, fine lines and translucent-window effects. Generated from authentic Nouns references; these are visual interpretations, not the exact-source print masters above.</p></div>
      <div class="nm-nordic-grid">{NORDIC_STUDIES.map((note,i)=><figure><a href={`/images/nouns-money/nordic-2027/${note.file}.webp`}><img src={`/images/nouns-money/nordic-2027/${note.file}.webp`} width="1400" height="700" loading="lazy" alt={`${note.name}, a generated Nordic 2027 Nouns Money currency-inspired concept${note.referenceNoun === null ? '' : ` using a reference to Noun #${note.referenceNoun}`}; visual effects only`}/></a><figcaption><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / {note.name}</span><span>GENERATED STUDY</span></figcaption></figure>)}</div>
      <p class="nm-footnote">Concept art, never legal tender. The engraved, iridescent and translucent details are proposed visual effects; no material, authentication or security functionality has been made or tested. Printed numbers and serial-like marks are fictional design elements. Use Collection 01’s original SVG/PNG files for exact-source artwork; these images are not production-ready files.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="nm-section nm-campaign" id="campaign" aria-labelledby="campaign-title">
      <div class="nm-heading"><div><p class="nm-kicker">NOUNS MONEY · CAMPAIGN ART</p><h2 id="campaign-title">Small notes.<br/><em>Big stories.</em></h2></div><p>A few pictures for the collecting room. Generated campaign artwork imagines the notes as physical objects; it does not document printing, trades or a launched edition.</p></div>
      <div class="nm-poster-grid">{CAMPAIGN_POSTERS.map(poster=><figure><a href={`/images/nouns-money/campaign/${poster.file}.webp`}><img src={`/images/nouns-money/campaign/${poster.file}.webp`} width="900" height="1350" loading="lazy" alt={poster.alt}/></a><figcaption><span>{poster.title}</span><span>GENERATED CAMPAIGN ART</span></figcaption></figure>)}</div>
    </section>
    <section class="nm-section nm-print" id="paper" aria-labelledby="paper-title">
      <div class="nm-heading"><div><p class="nm-kicker">FROM SCREEN TO A SMALL STACK · PROPOSED</p><h2 id="paper-title">Pick up from<br/><em>the printer.</em></h2></div><p>Then a soft fold. A pocket. A good afternoon. A physical edition could gain character as it travels. This photographic mockup imagines a physical collection; it is not a pixel-exact print source or evidence of production. The downloadable flat artwork is authoritative.</p></div>
      <div class="nm-paper-story"><figure><img src="/images/nouns-money/physical-collection.webp" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Generated photographic mockup of four Nouns Money designs, a matte-paper stack and an archival sleeve; not evidence of physical production" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>GENERATED PHOTOGRAPHIC MOCKUP · PHYSICAL EDITION PROPOSED</figcaption></figure><div><ol><li><span>01 / PRINTER PICKUP</span><p>Check the proof. Square corners, clear pixels, the paper that feels right.</p></li><li><span>02 / A LITTLE WEATHERED</span><p>A soft fold and a worn edge. Character belongs to the object, never a price chart.</p></li><li><span>03 / WELL TRAVELLED</span><p>Someone adds a story. Someone else gets curious. The next chapter begins.</p></li></ol></div></div>
      <dl class="nm-spec"><div><dt>DESIGN TRIM</dt><dd>{MONEY.noteSpec.trimMm.join(' × ')} mm</dd></div><div><dt>ARTWORK</dt><dd>Actual numbered Nouns</dd></div><div><dt>EDITION</dt><dd>Front-face prototypes</dd></div><div><dt>PHYSICAL PROOF</dt><dd>Still to be made</dd></div></dl>
      <p class="nm-footnote">{MONEY.noteSpec.printerHandoff} Collection 01 has RGB previews, outlined lettering and 3600 × 1800 px originals; its flat masters lack calibrated CMYK, bleed, crop marks and duplex backs. The separate Nordic proof PDFs below include trim marks. No paper proof, printer order or finishing guarantee is claimed.</p>
      <div class="nm-proof-panel" id="print-proofs"><figure><a href={MONEY.printProofs.threeDesignSheet}><img src="/images/nouns-money/campaign/three-design-print-proof.webp" width="612" height="792" loading="lazy" alt="Preview of the US Letter three-design proof sheet with Ice Blue One, Glacier Mint Ten and Rose Charcoal 100, trim marks and a 50 mm measuring line"/></a><figcaption>DIGITAL PRINT PROOF · NOT A PHYSICAL SAMPLE</figcaption></figure><div><p class="nm-kicker">THREE DESIGNS · ONE LETTER SHEET</p><h3>A small proof.<br/>A real size.</h3><p>Ice Blue One, Glacier Mint Ten and Rose Charcoal 100. Each image area is 150 × 75 mm on a single-sided US Letter sheet. Print at 100% / Actual Size with Fit and Shrink disabled. Check the 50 mm measuring line first.</p><div class="nm-proof-actions"><a href={MONEY.printProofs.threeDesignSheet} download>Download three-design sheet PDF ↓</a><a href={MONEY.printProofs.tenDesignSampler} download>Download all-ten sampler PDF ↓</a></div><ul><li>10 copies of the three-design sheet → 30 notes, ten of each design.</li><li>25 copies → 75 notes, twenty-five of each design.</li></ul><p class="nm-footnote">Digital proofs from generated studies. The image area includes the original border; the visible note may be smaller. Confirm supported paper, color and cutting with the printer. Foil and translucent windows are flat printed effects. No physical printing, order, duplex reverse or press certification is claimed.</p></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="nm-section nm-journeys" id="journeys" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
      <div class="nm-heading"><div><p class="nm-kicker">SERIALS &amp; STORIES · THE NEXT IDEA</p><h2 id="journey-title">Every little note.<br/><em>A little life.</em></h2></div><p>A proposed art-trade ritual: choose a note, share something creative, leave an optional trace. Participation would always be voluntary.</p></div>
      <div class="nm-three">{MONEY.exchange.map(item=><article><span class="nm-step">{item.step}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.body}</p></article>)}</div>
      <div class="nm-ledger"><div><p class="nm-kicker">FICTIONAL SERIAL EXAMPLE</p><h3>NM-001-DEMO</h3><p>Three imagined stops. One story in the making.</p></div><ol><li><span>01 · FIRST PROOF</span><p>One last color check. A blank reverse waiting for a story.</p></li><li><span>02 · ART TABLE</span><p>A drawing changes hands. Someone chooses their favorite.</p></li><li><span>03 · A FRIEND’S POCKET</span><p>Folded once. Carried home. Ready for a new chapter.</p></li></ol><p class="nm-footnote">All stops are imagined. No real participants, transfer records or public submission service exist. Saved designs above are a local list, separate from this proposed serial service.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="nm-section nm-build" id="build" aria-labelledby="build-title"><div class="nm-heading"><div><p class="nm-kicker">LEAN BUILD SCOPE · COLLECTING FIRST</p><h2 id="build-title">A set today.<br/><em>A table next.</em></h2></div><p>A proposed sequence for a small team. Timing is an estimate. Each step starts with a useful object and a clear reason to make the next one.</p></div><div class="nm-phases">{MONEY.phases.map(item=><article><span class="nm-step">{item.phase}</span><div><p class="nm-kicker">{item.status}</p><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.scope}</p><p class="nm-exit"><strong>Ready when:</strong> {item.exit}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="nm-section nm-context" aria-labelledby="context-title"><p class="nm-kicker">FUTURE ADVENTURES · SECONDARY CONCEPT CONTEXT</p><h2 id="context-title">Somewhere<br/><em>to get together.</em></h2><div class="nm-context-grid"><details><summary>El Segundo · a possible art afternoon</summary><p>Start with a hosted table or temporary gallery. An operating Citizens Business Bank at 275 Main Street is a likely reference to Mike’s “citizen,” but the intended bank is uncertain. It is unaffiliated, and no sale, acquisition, partnership or owner permission is established.</p><p>Any venue needs verified availability, permitted use, accessibility, insurance and written host or owner permission.</p><a href={MONEY.localResearch.source}>Official bank locator ↗</a><a href={MONEY.localResearch.planningSource}>City planning framework ↗</a><p class="nm-footnote">Location research checked 2 October 2026. No property price, live lease quote or merchant commitment.</p></details><details><summary>Adventure DAO · people + agents</summary><p>{MONEY.adventure.description}</p><ul>{MONEY.adventure.missions.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul><p class="nm-footnote">{MONEY.adventure.disclosure}</p></details></div></section>
    <footer class="nm-footer"><img src="/images/nouns-money/noun-0000-original.svg" width="96" height="96" alt="Actual original Noun #0" loading="lazy"/><div><p class="nm-kicker">A SMALL ORIGINAL OPINION · CODEX</p><p>{MONEY.opinion.text}</p><p class="nm-credit">Direction: Mike Hoydich · Writing &amp; build: Codex · Nouns artwork: CC0</p><a href="/nouns-money.json">Read the machine edition ↗</a><a href="#top">Back to the collection ↑</a></div></footer>
    <script type="application/json" id="nouns-money-catalog" set:html={JSON.stringify(NOTE_DESIGNS).replaceAll('<','\\u003c')}/>
  </main>
</BlockLayout>
<script>
  import { initNounsMoney } from '../scripts/nouns-money-client.mjs';
  initNounsMoney();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load',initNounsMoney);
</script>
